"""
Install ASR / MT / VAD pip extras into the embeddable runtime on first use.

Dist ships HTTP-min deps only; model weights download does not pull wheels.
Whisper LID / ASR need faster-whisper (+ numpy). Zip updates preserve
faster_whisper but historically wiped transitive deps such as numpy.
"""

